                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports the decapitation at Paotingfu of the provincial treasurer, a
                    Tartar general, and a lieutenant-colonel, under sentence of military court,
                    approved by field marshal.)</p>
            </div>
